p.src:
Let $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Then $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ The extra term proportional to $\partial_\mu\theta$ prevents $\partial_\mu\phi$ from transforming like $\phi$. Therefore $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ is not invariant under arbitrary local phase rotations.

u.src:
Let $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Then $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ The extra term proportional to $\partial_\mu\theta$ prevents $\partial_\mu\phi$ from transforming like $\phi$. Therefore $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ is not invariant under arbitrary local phase rotations.

en:
Let $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Then $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ The extra term proportional to $\partial_\mu\theta$ prevents $\partial_\mu\phi$ from transforming like $\phi$. Therefore $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ is not invariant under arbitrary local phase rotations.

ja:
次を置く： $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ すると $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ $\partial_\mu\theta$に比例する余分な項が、$\partial_\mu\phi$が$\phi$のように変換するのを妨げる。したがって、$\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$は任意の局所位相回転の下で不変ではない。

zh:
设 $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ 则 $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ 正比于$\partial_\mu\theta$的额外项使$\partial_\mu\phi$不能像$\phi$那样变换。因此，$\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$在任意局域相位旋转下并不不变。

fr:
Soit $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Alors $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ Le terme supplémentaire proportionnel à $\partial_\mu\theta$ empêche $\partial_\mu\phi$ de se transformer comme $\phi$. Par conséquent, $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ n’est pas invariant sous des rotations de phase locales arbitraires.

es:
Sea $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Entonces $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ El término adicional proporcional a $\partial_\mu\theta$ impide que $\partial_\mu\phi$ se transforme como $\phi$. Por tanto, $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ no es invariante bajo rotaciones de fase locales arbitrarias.

de:
Sei $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Dann gilt $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ Der zusätzliche Term proportional zu $\partial_\mu\theta$ verhindert, dass $\partial_\mu\phi$ sich wie $\phi$ transformiert. Daher ist $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ unter beliebigen lokalen Phasendrehungen nicht invariant.

zh-Hant:
令 $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ 則 $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ 其中與 $\partial_\mu\theta$ 成正比的額外項，使 $\partial_\mu\phi$ 不會像 $\phi$ 那樣變換。因此，$\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ 並非在任意局域相位旋轉下都保持不變。

vi:
Hãy đặt $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Khi đó $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ Hạng phụ tỉ lệ với $\partial_\mu\theta$ ngăn không cho $\partial_\mu\phi$ biến đổi giống như $\phi$. Vì vậy $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ không bất biến dưới các phép quay pha cục bộ tùy ý.

ru:
Пусть $\phi'(x)=e^{i\theta(x)}\phi(x).$ Тогда $\partial_\mu\phi'
  =e^{i\theta}
    \left(\partial_\mu\phi+i\,\partial_\mu\theta\,\phi\right).$ Лишний член, пропорциональный $\partial_\mu\theta$, мешает $\partial_\mu\phi$ преобразовываться так же, как $\phi$. Следовательно, $\partial_\mu\phi^*\partial^\mu\phi$ не инвариантно относительно произвольных локальных фазовых поворотов.

p.src:
Beforehand: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ A massless vector has two transverse polarizations. The complex scalar has two real components, radial and angular.

u.src:
Beforehand: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ A massless vector has two transverse polarizations. The complex scalar has two real components, radial and angular.

en:
Beforehand: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ A massless vector has two transverse polarizations. The complex scalar has two real components, radial and angular.

ja:
以前： $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ 質量のないベクトルは2つの横偏極を持つ。複素スカラーは動径成分と角度成分という2つの実成分を持つ。

zh:
之前： $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ 无质量矢量有两个横向极化。复标量有两个实分量，即径向分量和角向分量。

fr:
Avant : $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ Un vecteur sans masse a deux polarisations transverses. Le scalaire complexe a deux composantes réelles, radiale et angulaire.

es:
Antes: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ Un vector sin masa tiene dos polarizaciones transversales. El escalar complejo tiene dos componentes reales: una radial y otra angular.

de:
Vorher: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ Ein masseloser Vektor hat zwei transversale Polarisationen. Das komplexe Skalarfeld hat zwei reelle Komponenten: eine radiale und eine winkelabhängige.

zh-Hant:
之前： $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ 無質量向量有兩個橫向偏振；複純量則有兩個實分量，分別是徑向和角向分量。

vi:
Trước đó: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ Một vectơ không khối lượng có hai phân cực ngang. Vô hướng phức có hai thành phần thực, hướng kính và góc.

ru:
До перехода: $\underbrace{2}_{\text{massless vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{2}_{\text{complex scalar}}
  =4.$ У безмассового вектора две поперечные поляризации. У комплексного скаляра две действительные компоненты: радиальная и угловая.

p.src:
Afterward: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ A massive vector can be brought to rest. In its rest frame no spatial direction is privileged, so it must have three polarization states. When it moves, two are transverse and one is longitudinal. The Goldstone mode has become that longitudinal polarization.

u.src:
Afterward: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ A massive vector can be brought to rest. In its rest frame no spatial direction is privileged, so it must have three polarization states. When it moves, two are transverse and one is longitudinal. The Goldstone mode has become that longitudinal polarization.

en:
Afterward: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ A massive vector can be brought to rest. In its rest frame no spatial direction is privileged, so it must have three polarization states. When it moves, two are transverse and one is longitudinal. The Goldstone mode has become that longitudinal polarization.

ja:
以後： $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ 質量を持つベクトルは静止させることができる。その静止系では空間方向が特別扱いされないため、3つの偏極状態を持たなければならない。運動しているときは、2つが横偏極で1つが縦偏極である。ゴールドストーンモードはその縦偏極になったのである。

zh:
之后： $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ 带质量矢量可以被带到静止。在其静止系中没有任何空间方向是特殊的，因此它必须有三个极化态。当它运动时，两个是横向的，一个是纵向的。戈德斯通模变成了那个纵向极化。

fr:
Après : $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ On peut placer un vecteur massif au repos. Dans son référentiel de repos, aucune direction spatiale n’est privilégiée ; il doit donc avoir trois états de polarisation. Lorsqu’il est en mouvement, deux sont transverses et une est longitudinale. Le mode de Goldstone est devenu cette polarisation longitudinale.

es:
Después: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ Un vector masivo puede ponerse en reposo. En su sistema de reposo no hay ninguna dirección espacial privilegiada, así que debe tener tres estados de polarización. Cuando se mueve, dos son transversales y uno es longitudinal. El modo de Goldstone se ha convertido en esa polarización longitudinal.

de:
Nachher: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ Ein massiver Vektor lässt sich in sein Ruhesystem bringen. Dort ist keine räumliche Richtung ausgezeichnet, daher muss er drei Polarisationszustände besitzen. Bei Bewegung sind zwei davon transversal und einer longitudinal. Der Goldstone-Modus ist zu dieser longitudinalen Polarisation geworden.

zh-Hant:
之後： $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ 有質量的向量可以在其靜止系中描述。靜止系裡沒有任何空間方向特別突出，因此它必須有三種偏振態。向量運動時，其中兩種是橫向偏振，一種是縱向偏振。戈德斯通模態便成為這個縱向偏振。

vi:
Sau đó: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ Một vectơ có khối lượng có thể được đưa về trạng thái nghỉ. Trong hệ quy chiếu nghỉ của nó không có hướng không gian nào được ưu tiên, nên nó phải có ba trạng thái phân cực. Khi chuyển động, hai trạng thái là ngang và một trạng thái là dọc. Mode Goldstone đã trở thành phân cực dọc đó.

ru:
После перехода: $\underbrace{3}_{\text{massive vector}}
  +
  \underbrace{1}_{\text{radial Higgs}}
  =4.$ Массивный вектор можно перевести в состояние покоя. В его системе покоя никакое пространственное направление не является выделенным, поэтому у него должны быть три состояния поляризации. Когда он движется, две поляризации поперечные, а одна продольная. Голдстоуновская мода стала этой продольной поляризацией.
